From 8dbfa1393745c1731164dfea7d887962c02f4b32 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: havok2-htwo <havok2-htwo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 03:05:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 02/17] verify, prefill, mtp: the overlapped read's hooks
 (STRATA_PIPE_OVERLAP, our 377f1b33 74a3b4f2 c6939188 ffed4ec3 4c7616fc)

The device-side hooks STRATA_PIPE_OVERLAP's read (next commit) calls; with the env off nothing calls them.
- Verifier: set_stream_priority_high (before init: the window stream at the greatest priority, told once per card),
  has_batch_layout / layout_captured, ensure_batch_layouts (c6939188 form, the narrower widths a group may shrink to
  first), set_no_capture (stage_batch then fails with "not captured before an overlapped read"), the urgent PLE
  gather's ms_ple_urgent / n_ple_urgent.
- MtpDrafter::set_stream_priority (STRATA_PIPE_OVERLAP_MTP_PRIO), the want_hi form in load.
- Prefill: device(), overlap_safe(why), chain_cuda_error() with cuda_err_ (reset per run), join_chain(), and
  run_impl's PLE predicate factored into ple_on_() / ple_batched_() (the same expression, read live).

Adaptations to v0.2.12:
- Verifier::ar_live() is upstream already (ADMIT_MERGE_FIRST's gate): not added again.
- Verifier::init builds its streams through make_stream (STRATA_PIPED_CONCURRENT[_PRIO], STRATA_GRAPH_PRIO). Ours
  comes first and only for cs_ (not with set_stream / ext_stream_); when it made the stream, make_stream is skipped,
  otherwise make_stream runs as upstream. copy_ and sh_cs_ are untouched.
- MtpDrafter::reserve_prefill(n) (upstream, #31) is a superset of our reserve_prefill_records (it also reserves the
  pinned record ring) and prefill_per_group_sync() is already factored: neither of ours is ported.
- ensure_batch_layouts / has_batch_layout size their row lists by kVerifyMaxT (the 12/16-row builds,
  STRATA_VERIFY_MAX_T) instead of 8 and refuse a wider group. Both graphs are captured unconditionally: PIPED_MTP's
  deferred commits (staging_deferred_) never get here, the gate refuses it.
- Production's STRATA_BATCH_SELF_COMMIT follow-up (4c7616fc) is upstream's batch_self_commits here: layout_captured
  asks for no commit graph and ensure_batch_layouts uploads none for a self-committing layout.
- ple_batched_ uses upstream's ple_batch_enabled() (the CUDA 12.8 / CC 12.0 default) in place of our env read.
- cuda_err_ is captured on both chain launches: the std::async one and STRATA_HANDOFF_PIPE's persistent HandWorker
  (before its cudaGetLastError; upstream's HANDOFF_PIPE port had no chain_cuda_error, production runs HANDOFF_PIPE=8).
  The layer-major walk's lm_run thread does not capture (the gate refuses layer-major, as production's had none).

Checked: verify.cpp, mtp.cpp, prefill.cpp pass -fsyntax-only with the integration build's flags (212i's compile DB).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
